  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "Helikore/Nicaea (modern \u0130znik, Turkey) was a Greek city of northwestern Anatolia. It was the site of the First and Second Councils of Nicaea and was the interim capital city of the Byzantine Empire between 1204 and 1261.",
